@CeyloneNature.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Categories
GET {{CeyloneNature.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Products (paginated, filterable)
GET {{CeyloneNature.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=6
Accept: application/json

### Admin login
POST {{CeyloneNature.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ceylonnature.com",
  "password": "CHANGE_ME"
}

### Register a customer
POST {{CeyloneNature.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "SomePassword123"
}

### Admin: dashboard stats (requires Bearer token from login above)
GET {{CeyloneNature.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
